  "name": "Issue 1062: Frozen Earth lengthens Ice Rune and Palm Sigil: Earth's stun by 1 sec",
  "contract": [
    "Frozen Earth 705592 (Riftblade talent) reads 'Increases the duration of Ice Rune and the stun effect from",
    "Palm Sigil: Earth by $/1000;s1 sec.' Its only effect is aura 107, a flat SPELLMOD_DURATION (1) of BasePoints",
    "999 + DieSides 1 = 1000 ms on family 38 mask0 0x82. Ice Rune 524930 carries mask0 0x1000002 and Palm Sigil:",
    "Earth's stun 807824 mask0 0x80; both last SpellDuration 35 = 4000 ms. Aura::CalcMaxDuration applies the",
    "caster's SPELLMOD_DURATION, so no script is needed. Expected: 4000 ms without the talent and 5000 ms with it",
    "on both, read from the applied aura on a fresh enemy each time (no diminishing return), and back to 4000 when",
    "the talent is removed. Ice Rune requires a Frozen target, supplied by a mage's Frost Nova 122. The stun is",
    "cast directly: Palm Sigil: Earth 805382 itself has ProcFlags 0 and no spell_proc row, so it never casts it."
  ],
